# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P8, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w7
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap FX
expect view 13
turn K1 15 40
turn K2 35 40
tap ARP
turn K1 45 60
wait 1500
wav warble.wav
# @ P8 Sibyl with its echoes up and its Swell quick: the drones dip about once a second, the echoes ring in the gaps
wait 1500
tap LFO
tap LFO
expect view 7
# @ Delay all the way up (Mods): the LFO wobbles the delay's time by a quarter, and every echo bends in the gaps
turn K3 80 30
wait 6000
shot warble-0.png
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 14
# @ A longer Time (Details): deeper, slower bends
turn K2 15 60
wait 6000
shot warble-1.png
wavstop
